近未来しか勝たん
Near future is the best,

506
00:41:40,584 --> 00:41:41,884
ショッピングモールの現代コンピュー
modern computer in a shopping mall,

507
00:41:41,884 --> 00:41:43,084
小窓 死とか加担
Small window, complicit in death,

508
