オイルマッサージ100分コース 足湯付き
100-minute oil massage course with foot bath,

511
00:41:48,084 --> 00:41:49,084
柚子を添えて
garnished with yuzu.

512
00:41:49,084 --> 00:41:51,884
テテテテトテトテテテテテトリス
Te-te-te-te-to-te-to-te-te-te-te-Tetris!

513
00:41:51,884 --> 00:41:54,584
どうしてこんな目に に に
Why am I going through this, this, this?

514
00:41:54,584 --> 00:42:00,084
興味がないこと本気じゃないもの全部後回しで
Putting off everything I'm not interested in or not serious about,

515
00:42:00,084 --> 00:42:05,584
知ってることは知らんぷり 私は終わってる
feigning ignorance about things I know, I'm completely hopeless.

516
00:42:05,584 --> 00:42:11,584
恥ずかしい過去知ってる奴らの記憶消させて
Let me erase the memories of those who know my embarrassing past,

517
00:42:11,584 --> 00:42:17,584
迷惑かけてごめんってば ねぇ誰か助けて
I said I'm sorry for being a hassle, hey, someone help me!

518
